Server init.

>> message := ['this is a string to be encrypted!'].
>> key := ['secret123!'].
>> vault := Pahu-kūʻono hou: ['myvault'].

>> encrypted := vault hoʻohuna: message kī: key.
>> decrypted := vault wehe-huna: encrypted kī: key.

Huapuka 
kākau: ['Message:'], laina-hou
kākau: message, laina-hou
kākau: ['Decrypted:'], laina-hou
kākau: decrypted, laina-hou.
